{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26145","headline":"忆山中 · 陈去疾","name":"忆山中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长吟重悒然，爲忆山中年。\n清瑟泛遥夜，乱花随暮烟。\n珠林余露气，乳窦滴香泉。\n迹远尘埃外，花开绮藻前。\n岩罗云貌逸，竹抱水容妍。\n蕙磴飞英遶，萍潭片影悬。\n林藏诸曲胜，台擅一峰偏。\n会可标真寄，焚香对石筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈去疾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}